  <item>
    <title>vol.24 2024上半年观剧盘点，中国音乐剧再不努力我就要移情别恋了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c60beddb5e6d6bf9fea258</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c60beddb5e6d6bf9fea258</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Aug 2024 15:46:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【编者引】</span></p><span></span><p><span>时光如梭，2024转眼间已经过半，年初我们做了新剧盘点，那这期就让我们来看看有哪些已经被我们试水了</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时年初远离剧场的flag到底有没有倒，一起在节目里找倒答案吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;新剧试毒盘点&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 胭脂扣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a> 麦克白夫人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 游戏法则(时光代理人大剧场)</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;上半年多刷的剧&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 阴天，trace U，</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 时光代理人小剧场 (穿插47 小插曲)</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;上半年难抢的戏&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 演唱会,人间失格百场，电影节</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;上半年优秀舞美&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">30:33</a> 大彗星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1924">32:04</a> 清明上河图密码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2084">34:44</a> 西游</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;上半年最佳歌曲&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 杨戬，胭脂扣，重聚，小时光</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;上半年印象深刻的演员&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2521">42:01</a> 大彗星皮埃尔，太子张智涵，徐杭</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;上半年的黑榜&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a> 玻璃动物园，永和九年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3138">52:18</a> 英语灯塔,马三伯，粉丝来信</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;上半年其他推荐的戏&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3520">58:40</a> 887， 芝加哥，杂技战，上海长江剧场滑稽戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stella</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bu</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: SoundForYou - Optimistic Summer Pop</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢CCPA场地提供~~~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpToNVqA4T_8gQSjZeNgGTMa7Adm.m4a" length="91567633" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgaRa37J6Z4czsjjZQkZQxXsM20M.png"/>
