  <item>
    <title>vol.23 这一次在凉爽的初夏，再一次感受人间失格-记青岛skr之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b745f833591c27be182c8f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b745f833591c27be182c8f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Aug 2024 10:50:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【编者引】</span></p><span></span><p><span>决定去青岛是6.4百场之后，原以为看完百场能安心的毕业，但是终究还是不甘心</span></p><span></span><p><span>和stella一起去了青岛，收获了这一个美好，难忘绚烂的夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span>奇妙的经历增加了一些，三次偶遇刘令飞老师，终于不用赶回家错过sd，看到了见面会，近距离收获一大波表情包，还有很多爱skr的剧友同好，依然常看常新的舞台演绎，21年至今，或许是可以很好地说再见了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>回上海之后和stella回顾了一下两天的快乐经历，就让所有的爱都停留在最美好的时候吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 一个多小时三次偶遇刘令飞的神奇经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 亚森浑然天成的堀木让人觉得是不是要查一下他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 范金锴 换歌如换人，董豫辰不一样演绎但同样优秀的伊藤先生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> 青出于蓝如鱼得水的白举纲，人间失格不能没有小白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> 会整活的粉丝，夏日烟火，精致有意义的周边，都是对人间失格的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关内容</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>去年812神场之后录制的节目 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ff32686884ccbb19a70d1f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ff32686884ccbb19a70d1f"><span>vol.02 官摄赶快的！这次的人间失格让我们在线喊话染空间 | 值得多刷的剧(一）</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>董豫辰 新戏boom夏卡拉卡亚洲大厦1楼星球剧场</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhNxpZX20XAlhc_5yVr0KYOFFghw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FksYDjHX1mmk5uRm_tghTvJEQHLN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhx83dOlrCKqfLUs7quifHilflvh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stella</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: SoundForYou - Optimistic Summer Pop</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu-u9S6u3OhmD7EFFb8kXskYxFP9.m4a" length="70504829" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgaRa37J6Z4czsjjZQkZQxXsM20M.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.22 三年后再去日本看杰尼斯却变成一场忐忑的冒险</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669fc8c2c3b5ec0b31ab2be8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669fc8c2c3b5ec0b31ab2be8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jul 2024 15:14:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期录制的时候出了点小意外所以bu老师的声音不太清晰，请见谅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【编者引】</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近在断更的边缘，终于又回来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期不聊中国的剧场了，5月底sophia终于又去日本看了杰尼斯的演唱会，但是这次发现和曾经有了很多不一样，有好有坏，所以就想和大家来聊一聊，分享一下作为外国人去海外看演唱会的经历，希望可以给到大家一些参考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 现在杰尼斯丝滑便捷入会流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 抽票开始严格了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> 票通购票难度提升，现场会有更多不可控风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">34:09</a> &nbsp;聊聊一看就是杰尼斯追星会做的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stella</span></p><span></span><p><span>bu</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: SoundForYou - Optimistic Summer Pop</span></p><span></span><p><span>【场地感谢】</span></p><span></span><p><span>CCPA上海播客艺术中心</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkOBql8atnaoyYkz3GsMTAuEjbX1.m4a" length="75238597" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgaRa37J6Z4czsjjZQkZQxXsM20M.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.21 看剧需要听劝，好奇心什么的丢了吧-踩雷黑历史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666bdb5db6a8412729b1af4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666bdb5db6a8412729b1af4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 05:55:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【编者引】</span></p><span></span><p><span>都说中国音乐剧靠观众的好奇心活着</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是对于观众来说，凭什么要为了那些不合格试验品花钱花时间还有可能结节呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我们就分享了一下自己不听劝的血泪史，也欢迎大家一起来分享，能劝一个算一个！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 猎罪图鉴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 南墙计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 我要你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 麻花话剧 威尼斯商人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 其他非差评讨论: 大彗星，星辰</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stella</span></p><span></span><p><span>bu</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: SoundForYou - Optimistic Summer Pop</span></p><span></span><p><span>间奏: ZARD 負けないで</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾: 音乐剧《星辰》选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>【场地感谢】</span></p><span></span><p><span>CCPA上海播客艺术中心</span></p>]]></description>
