    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【编者引】</span></p><p><span>又是一年520，虽然主播们都是单身狗，520大概率又是在剧场度过。但是我们可以来聊聊那些在剧场里遇到的情侣奇遇以及戏剧里我们所看到的各色动容的爱情。祝大家每一天都充满爱</span></p><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 剧场相亲各种奇遇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> 剧场解说聊天型情侣</span></p><p><span>戏剧里的爱情 - 美好的大众爱情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 舞台广播剧 三昧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> 音乐剧 I Love U</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 音乐剧 如果</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 音乐剧 春宵苦短少女前进吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 音乐剧 Once &amp; 罗朱</span></p><p><span>戏剧里的爱情 - 渣男戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 话剧 你好，我找smith</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 音乐剧 致命旋律</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 音乐剧 唐璜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> 音乐剧 致爱</span></p><p><span>戏剧里的爱情 - 跨越世俗的爱情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 音乐剧 危险游戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> 音乐剧 消失</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 音乐剧 蝶变 &amp; lizzie</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 音乐剧 阴天</span></p><p><span>520 推荐情侣戏剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a> 音乐剧 爱情神话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2129">35:29</a> 音乐剧 小火焰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2281">38:01</a> 音乐剧 时光代理人小剧场，嗜血博士</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>Sophia</span></p><p><span>Stella</span></p><p><span>馨馨子</span></p><p><span>【剪辑制作】</span></p><p><span>Sophia</span></p><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><p><span>片头: shoose おじゃま虫<