  <item>
    <title>vol.16 欧洲人恶趣味起来中国音乐剧也要甘拜下风 - 出国看剧(1)欧洲篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d61cb4513a776b5789f4f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d61cb4513a776b5789f4f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Feb 2024 15:54:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【编者引】</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历了特殊的三年，终于我们又可以出去看戏啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>出国看剧会做一个系列，第一期请到了去年10月份刚去过意大利法国的朋友一起来聊一聊，</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望给大家一些tips</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于去法国意大利看剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>1) 签证: 欧洲法国签证相对好出，推荐中介，可代做行程，无须提前购买机票</span></p><span></span><p><span>2) 购票指南:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vivaticket &nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.vivaticket.com/it" data-url="https://www.vivaticket.com/it"><span>www.vivaticket.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Ticketone </span><a href="https://www.ticketone.it/" data-url="https://www.ticketone.it/"><span>www.ticketone.it</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>德国: 可以使用eventim的app</span></p><span></span><p><span>剧院官网: 如巴黎歌剧院，罗马歌剧院</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> 嘉宾快问快答，过往看剧经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 本次行程介绍，法国看了新版唐璜，去意大利看歌剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="451">07:31</a> 欧洲签证攻略-尽量提早，法国相对方便</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 欧洲戏剧开票情况，歌剧更难买票，但有机会捡漏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 瓦格纳歌剧是大家看歌剧的里程碑，欧洲和上海大剧院有什么不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a> 欧洲戏剧票价并不贵，购票指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1431">23:51</a> 国外戏剧讯息-小红书yyds</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 欧洲看戏住宿相关-感谢小红书摇到了海外志同道合的小伙伴，海外看戏要注意安全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 拉面SD中国妹子含量高，还有和保安游击战，和有意思的整活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a> 意大利剧院魅影很多让人匪夷所思的改编</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stella</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mirus</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sophia</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: SoundForYou - Optimistic Summer Pop</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: sun ray happiness</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾: All I Ask Of You - 音乐剧《歌剧魅影》</span></p>]]></description>
